<!-- Delta package for the code-review corrective work (commit 5e068c8).
     Deployable to any org that already carries the anonymization package — standard (TEKCO)
     and non-standard (Portugal/ALH) alike.

     Contents: every component the review changed, plus TEKCO_ContentDocumentDeleteService /
     TEKCO_FieldHistoryDeleteService and their tests — the batches now delegate their delete
     phases to these services, and neither full manifest was shipping them.

     Cleanup of the obsolete Portugal_ALH org-config record in orgs that received it is a
     separate destructive step:
       sf project deploy start ~-manifest anonymization/manifest/package-review-fixes.xml
           ~-post-destructive-changes anonymization/manifest/destructiveChanges-review-fixes.xml
           ~-target-org <alias>
     (replace ~- with double dashes; XML comments cannot contain them)
-->
